  "notes": "Smallest tier of the GPT-5.6 family (system card: the fastest and most cost-efficient model). The deprecations page names gpt-5.6-luna as the replacement for gpt-5-nano-2025-08-07 and gpt-4.1-nano. On 2026-07-30 its API price was cut by 80%. From the week of 2026-08-06 GPT-5.6 Luna became the default ChatGPT model for Free and Go users; the GPT-5.6 August Updates system card treats that ChatGPT release as an August version, distinct from the July version kept in Codex and ChatGPT Work, but OpenAI announced it as an access change rather than as an update of Luna, so it has no separate record (the research draft openai.gpt-5-6-luna-2026-08 was dropped). The openai.com posts were read through Wayback Machine captures."
